---
// About snapshot shown on homepage
---

<section class="about" id="about">
  <div class="wrap">
    <span class="sec-label sr">01 — About</span>
    <h2 class="sec-head sr sr-d1">The Standard<br/>Stays High.</h2>

    <div class="about-grid">
      <div class="sr sr-d2">
        <p class="about-pull">""I don't let you walk out looking anything less than what you came in for."</p>
        <p class="about-body">
          Started cutting in my garage. Now I got my own loft at Salon Lofts Sawmill, Suite 13 in Dublin.
          Long way from where I started but the way I work hasn't changed at all.
        </p>
        <p class="about-sig">— <strong>Yeremie Mijon</strong></p>
        <div class="about-actions">
          <a href="/about" class="btn btn-line">Read the Full Story →</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="chk sr sr-d3">
        <div class="chk-item"><span class="chk-num">01</span><span>We talk before I touch your hair</span></div>
        <div class="chk-item"><span class="chk-num">02</span><span>I blend the fade to your face not a random template</span></div>
        <div class="chk-item"><span class="chk-num">03</span><span>I check it until its actually right</span></div>
        <div class="chk-item"><span class="chk-num">04</span><span>No waiting room no distractions just the cut</span></div>
        <div class="chk-item"><span class="chk-num">05</span><span>Book online pull up get taken care of</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about { padding: 6rem 0; background: #0f0e0c; border-top: 1px solid var(--border); }
  .about-grid { display: grid; gap: 4rem; margin-top: 3.5rem; }
  @media(min-width: 960px) { .about-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 6rem; align-items: start; } }
  .about-pull { font-size: 1.15rem; font-style: italic; font-weight: 300; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--text); border-left: 2px solid var(--red); padding-left: 1.25rem; margin-bottom: 1.4rem; }
  .about-body { font-size: .93rem; color: var(--dim); line-height: 1.85; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
  .about-sig { font-family: var(--fm); font-size: .65rem; letter-spacing: .14em; color: var(--dim); }
  .about-sig strong { color: var(--text); }
  .about-actions { margin-top: 1.75rem; }
  .chk { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0; border: 1px solid var(--border); }
  .chk-item { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 1rem; padding: 1rem 1.2rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); font-size: .9rem; color: var(--dim); transition: background .15s; }
  .chk-item:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
  .chk-item:hover { background: var(--bg3); }
  .chk-num { font-family: var(--fd); font-size: 1.5rem; letter-spacing: .04em; color: var(--border); min-width: 2rem; line-height: 1; }
  .chk-item:hover .chk-num { color: var(--red); }
</style>